l | WoW Forever Shaman Field Guide",nav={{id="overview",x=S[767]},{id="journey",x=S[560]},{id="talents",x=S[484]},{id="stats",x=S[608]},{id="combat",x=S[609]},{id="macros",x=S[610]},{id="dungeons",x=S[540]},{id="professions",x=S[561]},{id="crafting",x=S[549]},{id="questgear",x=S[531]},{id=S[483],x=S[702]}},asideNote=S[68],talentString="5500331021011351054000000000000000053020001",ranks={{tree="Elemental",name="Convection",r=5,max=5},{tree="Elemental",name="Concussion",r=5,max=5},{tree="Elemental",name="Elemental Alacrity",r=3,max=3},{tree="Elemental",name="Call of Flame",r=3,max=3},{tree="Elemental",name=S[879],r=1,max=1},{tree="Elemental",name="Trial by Fire",r=2,max=2},{tree="Elemental",name="Eye of the Storm",r=1,max=3},{tree="Elemental",name="Elemental Reach",r=1,max=2},{tree="Elemental",name="Call of Thunder",r=1,max=1},{tree="Elemental",name="Lightning Overload",r=3,max=3},{tree="Elemental",name="Elemental Fury",r=5,max=5},{tree="Elemental",name=S[645],r=1,max=1},{tree="Enhancement",name=S[611],r=5,max=5},{tree="Enhancement",name=S[593],r=4,max=5},{tree="Restoration",name="Tidal Focus",r=5,max=5},{tree="Restoration",name="Mindfulness",r=3,max=3},{tree="Restoration",name="Totemic Focus",r=2,max=5},{tree="Restoration",name=S[819],r=1,max=1}},order={},blocks={{t="anchor",id="overview"},{t="p",s="eyebrow",x=S[532]},{t="h1",x="Elemental",sub=S[612]},{t="p",s="lede",x="Build reliable ranged pressure with Lightning Bolt and Flame Shock, then use Lightning Mastery and fire-totem area damage when the encounter allows."},{t="pills",list={S[538],S[562]}},{t="anchor",id="journey"},{t="kicker",x=S[768]},{t="h2",x=S[452]},{t="p",x=S[66]},{t="p",s="level",x="1–19 · Cast from a safe distance"},{t="p",x="Train Lightning Bolt and utility ranks, start pulls from range and keep room to retreat. Use melee only when a low-health enemy can be finished cheaply. Carry drinking water and avoid spending your entire mana pool on damage when a heal may be needed."},{t="p",s="level",x="20–39 · Develop the spell toolkit"},{t="p",x="Build toward the selected Elemental damage, casting and control talents while respecting the calculator’s gates. Earthbind becomes an additional control tool with Earthbound. Keep Flame Shock on enemies that live long enough and fill with Lightning Bolt; Call of Thunder adds critical strike chance to Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning. Chain Lightning joins the trained toolkit later; check nearby enemies before casting it."},{t="p",s="level",x="40–60 · Complete damage and sustain"},{t="p",x="Finish the Elemental package and the nine Enhancement and eleven Restoration support points. Thundering Strikes and Ancestral Knowledge support casting; Tidal Focus, Mindfulness, Totemic Focus and Water Shield add hit, mana recovery and cheaper totems."},{t="anchor",id="talents"},{t="kicker",x=S[485]},{t="h2",x=S[538]},{t="p",x="Tree order: Elemental / Enhancement / Restoration. These 51 points are entered on the Standards.gg talent calculator and checked against the launch talent trees for totals, maximum ranks, tier gates and prerequisites. Changes made inside the calculator do not rewrite this guide."},{t="widget",w="talents"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[541]},{t="widget",w="ranks"},{t="p",s="notice",x="Your build contains 31 Elemental, 9 Enhancement and 11 Restoration points. It does not learn Stormstrike, Shamanistic Focus or Nature’s Swiftness and takes no Natural Grace, so threat management remains important."},{t="anchor",id="stats"},{t="kicker",x=S[613]},{t="h2",x=S[509]},{t="p",x="Elemental wants spell damage first, then hit and critical strike. Intellect and mana per 5 keep you casting through long fights."},{t="h3",x=S[734]},{t="stat",i=1,b="Spell damage",x=S[557]},{t="stat",i=2,b="Intellect",x=S[793]},{t="stat",i=3,b="Stamina",x=""},{t="stat",i=4,b="Spirit",x=S[588]},{t="stat",i=5,b="Strength",x="only while you still melee early on"},{t="p",s="small",x="If you level as Enhancement first, keep useful Intellect and spell damage pieces for the switch around level 40."},{t="h3",x="At level 60"},{t="stat",i=1,b="Spell power",x=S[557]},{t="stat",i=2,b="Hit chance",x="to 17%"},{t="stat",i=3,b=S[703],x=""},{t="stat",i=4,b="Intellect",x=""},{t="stat",i=5,b="Mana per 5",x=""},{t="p",s="small",x="Spell penetration and haste are strong extras when an item offers them; balance them against Intellect and Spirit so you do not run out of mana."},{t="p",s="notice",x="Spell hit cap: 17% against raid bosses (level 63), 4% against enemies of your own level. The level 60 list is an early estimate: the beta stopped at level 30, so expect changes once endgame gear is known. A big upgrade in a lower stat can still beat a small one in a higher stat."},{t="anchor",id="combat"},{t="kicker",x=S[510]},{t="h2",x=S[550]},{t="p",x=S[81]},{t="h4",x="Set range and useful totems"},{t="p",x="Start from a safe casting position. Select totems for the party and encounter, rather than automatically dropping four for every quest enemy. Maintain enough mana to interrupt, cleanse or heal. Earthbound is useful control but does not make every boss rootable."},{t="h4",x="Keep Flame Shock ticking"},{t="p",x="On a target that will live long enough, apply Flame Shock and refresh it when it falls off. Your shocks share a cooldown, so keep Earth Shock free when an enemy caster needs interrupting."},{t="h4",x="Fill with Lightning Bolt"},{t="p",x="Use Lightning Bolt as your repeatable ranged cast. Lightning Overload is a passive proc; you do not press a separate ability to trigger it. Favor safe, uninterrupted casts over standing in dangerous ground effects. Eye of the Storm (1/3) gives some protection from pushback."},{t="h4",x="Match cleave to the pull"},{t="p",x="Chain Lightning is useful when its jumps are safe. Fire Nova erupts from your active fire totem; placement matters. Trial by Fire supports the area toolkit, but mana and crowd control still limit when it is worth using. Move the totems if the pack leaves their range."},{t="h4",x="Plan the Lightning Mastery window"},{t="p",x="Use Lightning Mastery when the target will survive and you can cast through its 15 seconds: it removes Chain Lightning’s cooldown and cuts 0.5 seconds from Lightning Bolt’s cast time. Line it up with racials and trinkets, and avoid emptying your mana merely because the button is available. Use Earth Shock to stop a dangerous cast, even when that interrupts a damage sequence."},{t="abil",names={S[898],"Flame Shock","Chain Lightning","Fire Nova",S[645]}},{t="h3",x=S[646]},{t="p",x="Compare spell damage that affects Nature and Fire, useful spell hit, Intellect, critical chance and mana recovery. A Nature-only piece supports your Lightning spells but not Flame Shock or your fire totems. Tidal Focus is selected at 5/5; evaluate its hit contribution before adding more. Melee weapon DPS is not a casting stat."},{t="p",x=S[64]},{t="h3",x=S[504]},{t="p",x=S[56]},{t="p",x=S[52]},{t="p",x=S[124]},{t="anchor",id="macros"},{t="kicker",x=S[614]},{t="h2",x=S[424]},{t="p",x=S[59]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[40]},{t="macro",n=S[551],x=S[126],code=S[201]},{t="macro",n=S[583],x=S[120],code=S[175]},{t="macro",n=S[594],x=S[113],code=S[199]},{t="macro",n=S[704],x=S[122],code=S[266]},{t="macro",n=S[563],x=S[121],code=S[230]},{t="macro",n=S[564],x=S[155],code=S[207]},{t="macro",n=S[552],x=S[247],code=S[202]},{t="macro",n=S[542],x=S[158],code=S[179]},{t="macro",n=S[565],x=S[94],code=S[173]},{t="macro",n=S[505],x=S[129],code=S[267]},{t="macro",n=S[615],x=S[160],code=S[342]},{t="macro",n=S[469],x=S[115],code=S[225]},{t="macro",n="Chain Lightning / Shift Flame Shock",x="Hold Shift to apply Flame Shock; otherwise cast Chain Lightning. The macro does not check the debuff or cast both spells through one global cooldown.",code="#showtooltip\n/cast [mod:shift,harm,nodead] Flame Shock; [harm,nodead] Chain Lightning"},{t="macro",n=S[645],x="Keep your selected damage cooldown on a deliberate key. Follow with the damaging spell appropriate for the encounter; no automated rotation is implied.",code="#showtooltip Lightning Mastery\n/cast Lightning Mastery"},{t="macro",n="Mouseover Lightning Bolt",x="Cast at a living hostile mouseover, otherwise your hostile target. It uses your learned spell rank without changing targets.",code="#showtooltip Lightning Bolt\n/cast [@mouseover,harm,nodead][harm,nodead] Lightning Bolt"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[256]},{t="anchor",id="dungeons"},{t="kicker",x=S[705]},{t="h2",x=S[474]},{t="p",x=S[60]},{t="widget",w="rarity"},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[46]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[74]},{t="widget",w="loot"},{t="anchor",id="professions"},{t="kicker",x=S[511]},{t="h2",x=S[470]},{t="p",x=S[61]},{t="widget",w="prof"},{t="anchor",id="crafting"},{t="kicker",x=S[543]},{t="h2",x=S[453]},{t="p",x=S[37]},{t="widget",w="craft"},{t="anchor",id="questgear"},{t="kicker",x=S[512]},{t="h2",x=S[420]},{t="p",x=S[41]},{t="widget",w="quest"},{t="anchor",id=S[483]},{t="kicker",x=S[706]},{t="h2",x="Your notes"},{t="widget",w="notes"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[91]}}},{id="enhancement",name="Enhancement",token="ENH",gearBrackets={{b="Quest rewards",no="Quest rewards that fit this spec's stat priority, sorted by quest level. The tooltip names the quest, its level, the quest giver and the faction. Quest level is not the minimum pickup level.",keys={"st-shaman-1","shaman-g99","shaman-g107","shaman-g31","shaman-g33","shaman-g194","shaman-g263","shaman-g44","shaman-g259","shaman-g83","shaman-g220","shaman-g125","shaman-g27","shaman-g208","shaman-g221","shaman-g13","shaman-g178","shaman-g202","shaman-g20","shaman-g46","shaman-g51","shaman-g56","shaman-g179","shaman-g226","shaman-g161","shaman-g218","shaman-g235","shaman-g40","shaman-g119","shaman-g147","shaman-g211","shaman-g232","shaman-g234","shaman-g69","shaman-g85","shaman-g106","shaman-g108","shaman-g180","shaman-g280","shaman-g95","shaman-g257","shaman-g258","shaman-g262","shaman-g96","shaman-g98","shaman-g267","shaman-g277","shaman-g282","shaman-g205","shaman-g243","shaman-g77","shama